            <ArticleTitle>Single soliton solution to the extended KdV equation over uneven depth.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>100</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1140/epje/i2017-11591-7</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>In this note we look at the influence of a shallow, uneven riverbed on a soliton. The idea consists in an approximate transformation of the equation governing wave motion over an uneven bottom to an equation for a flat one for which the exact solution exists. The calculation is one space dimensional, and so corresponds to long trenches or banks under wide rivers or oceans.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
